    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32418" root="غمز" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَارِيَةٌ غَمَّازَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A girl who presses,</i> or <i>squeezes,</i> or
<i>kneads, the limbs well with the hand.</i> (A, K, *
TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِمْرَأَةٌ غَمَّازَةٌ</span> (tropical:)  <i>A woman who makes frequent signs with the eye,</i> &amp;c.; <i>who has a habit of
doing so;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَمَّازَةٌ</span>. (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رمز</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَمَّازٌ</span>
One <i>who blames,</i> or <i>finds fault with, others, much,</i>
or <i>habitually.</i> (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">همز</span>.)

